  work. If this repo [3mis[0m the app, then notifications isn't the next thing to build, and the useful output of this session
  is a decomposition plus a design for whichever piece comes first.

  - [1mReal app is elsewhere[0m — point me at it; I design notifications against the actual model. Best outcome, if it's true.
  - [1mThis repo is the app[0m — we decompose, then brainstorm piece one (tasks + persistence). Slower to reach notifications,
